# Push changes

When the user says "push changes", or asks to push so Vercel picks the changes up, commit the current work and deploy production.

- Production follows `main`. A commit that stays on `react-layout` does not update https://www.impz.club.
- Commit on the current branch, cherry-pick that commit onto `main` if needed, then `git push origin main`.
- Switch back to the previous branch after the push.
- Do not force-push.
- Wait until the Vercel status for that commit is success before saying the live site is updated.
